normal dungeon until you find an appropriate wand.

Get yourself really fast, a lightsource, and some ranged weapons and kite
the little fucker around.

Get a wand of digging, take a move off the stairs away from the MMF, dig
down to get past him. Hope that the rest of the mines includes a way to
defeat him.

You probably do want to get ahold of that bones file. Unless the MMF is not
really a MMF (say, a chameleon), a character strong enough for a MMF pet
probably has some decent stuff to pillage (but which then brings up the
question of how he managed to die on the top level of the mines..don't
suppose you saw his gravestone, did you?). But there's no huge urgency to
hit up the mines. Patience is what wins games of nethack.


